  "notes": "Hussar aircraft-like elongated ovoid fuselage, forward glass canopy under a long dorsal center-torso laser cannon, high rear fins, spindly landing-gear limbs. Reference: TRO 3039 Hussar original art. 2026 multi-view resculpt: widened forward fuselage reach and extended center dorsal laser, reduced dangling arm bulk and narrowed legs.\nSecond source pass: individually separate lower arm, shin, torso/launcher moving masses; require fully rooted and face-connected assembly.\nLoad-bearing shoulder bosses: separately authored contiguous 3D frame collars, 5+ coarse-cell z-span, no isolated floating armor lips; broad arm bearings retained while surrounding profiles remain slim.",
